{"id":"n72305-1-12","stage":4,"title":"일감 · 活儿","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72305-1-12-1","ko":"오늘은 왜 이렇게 아침부터 바쁘세요?","zh":"今天怎么一大早就这么忙啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘은","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아침부터","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바쁘세요?","meaning":"忙，忙碌，紧张","explanation":"바쁘다：忙，忙碌，紧张；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"바쁘다","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66248","senseId":"1","lemma":"바쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"2fdd736548d881c6","term":"아침","zh":"早上，早晨","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3","entryId":"27368","definition":"从天渐渐变亮到太阳出来，一天的事情开始的时间。","pronunciation":["아침"]},{"id":"23457023f6034aaf","term":"바쁘다","zh":"忙，忙碌，紧张","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3","entryId":"66248","definition":"因为要做的事情多或没有时间而无暇顾及其他。","pronunciation":["바쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/de5a586dd0975592b5db.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72305-1-12-2","ko":"갑자기 새로운 일감이 떨어졌거든요.","zh":"因为突然有了新的工作任务。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"새로운","meaning":"新","explanation":"새롭다：新；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"새롭다","audio":"/audio/0dd73a3ec78548995542.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29029","senseId":"1","lemma":"새롭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일감이","meaning":"活儿，工作","explanation":"일감：活儿，工作；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일감","audio":"/audio/cd48ad4ebe6c437db3f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72305","senseId":"1","lemma":"일감","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떨어졌거든요.","meaning":"被分配，交给","explanation":"떨어지다：被分配，交给；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；거든요：礼貌地补充理由或背景。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"6","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"0dd73a3ec7854899","term":"새롭다","zh":"新","audio":"/audio/0dd73a3ec78548995542.mp3","entryId":"29029","definition":"与至今为止的东西不同或不曾存在过。","pronunciation":["새롭따"]},{"id":"cd48ad4ebe6c437d","term":"일감","zh":"活儿，工作","audio":"/audio/cd48ad4ebe6c437db3f1.mp3","entryId":"72305","definition":"能通过干活挣钱的事。","pronunciation":["일ː깜"]},{"id":